   "body": "**mac/M1**: Done in #1095 (merged as fd444bf420d0a2155272724ee684e1214dec61da): the grey skin's stylesheet is `R728c` (fetched without a session from the URL a logged-in user1 page links, operator's option 2). With #1091: default skin `R728a`, static stylesheet `R728b`, logo colour `#F18F18` as a run observation (no committed GIF, as the PR says). What gives an account the grey key is the follow-up #1096 (`/setperso.php`, not blocking LOT-193).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
